# WolkaraForever layer patch 0036 - profile: WoW Forever is released, not a beta
#
# Why: Battle.net now installs World of Warcraft Forever as the released game:
# the flavor directory is `_forever_`, the bundle is `World of Warcraft.app`, and
# the product is `wowf`. The profile and its installer still named the beta's
# `_classic_beta_/World of Warcraft Beta.app`, so a push of the released client
# would have looked for an executable that no longer exists.
#
# The installer also stops copying `Data` wholesale. `Data` holds the CASC store
# every product in one installation shares plus a per-product index folder; a
# beta's `wow_classic_beta` folder left behind (or on the Mac) belongs to a build
# that is not being installed, and copying it into the app's store would mix two
# builds' indexes. It now copies the shared store and the product's own folder,
# which `.flavor.info` names.
#
# Applies to: profiles/wow-forever/{profile.json,install.py,README.md}.
# Upstream: candidate.
#
